#: src/postulo/templates/help/telephone_numbers.html
msgid "Choose the country the number is in and type the number the way it is written there. Or type it in full, starting with +, and the country chosen is ignored. It is kept in the international form, so it can be dialled from anywhere, and documents print it grouped the way its country writes it."
