#: src/postulo/templates/resume/europass_import.html
msgid "Choose the PDF you downloaded from europass.europa.eu, as it is: the CV is attached inside it, and that is what Postulo reads. Older Europass files read too: the XML and PDF of the editor before 2020, and the JSON of its web service. Postulo works out which it is, shows you what is in it, and writes nothing until you say so."
msgstr "Odaberite PDF koji ste preuzeli s europass.europa.eu, onakav kakav jest: životopis je priložen unutar njega i to Postulo čita. Čitaju se i starije Europass datoteke: XML i PDF uređivača iz razdoblja prije 2020. i JSON njegove web-usluge. Postulo sam utvrdi o kojoj je vrsti riječ, pokaže vam što je u datoteci i ne zapisuje ništa dok ne potvrdite."

